---
import { figma } from '../../data/link'
---

<section id="hero" class="wrapper flex flex-col pt-20 2xl:pt-32">
  <h1>
    Hello. I'm <span class="text-white">Ayush Kumar</span>, a <span
      class="text-white">Full-stack Engineer</span
    > and <a
      href={figma}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="text-white border-gray-400 hover:border-white border-b-[0.00625rem] delay-200 ease-in-out duration-300">
      Designer</a
    >. I went from a ₹2,000 freelance page to holding a patent and today I build
    a marketplace used by <span class="text-white">11K+ people</span>.
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-10">
    Currently, Technical Lead at <a
      href="https://graminx.com/"
      target="_blank"
      class="text-white border-gray-400 hover:border-white border-b-[0.00625rem] delay-200 ease-in-out duration-300"
      >Graminx</a
    >. Before that, AI products at <a
      href="https://growigh.com/"
      target="_blank"
      class="text-white border-gray-400 hover:border-white border-b-[0.00625rem] delay-200 ease-in-out duration-300"
      >Growigh</a
    >
    .
    <p>Always building, learning, exploring.</p>
  </p>
</section>
